  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARTICLE 19 Freedom of Expression 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core funding to support Article 19. Freedom of expression (FoE) and information work in ODA countries and in international fora. Main aim is to promote and protect freedom of expression and information, protection of voice and and to adapt and respond to new strategic threats to FoE. Diversity, equality and inclusion integrated into all programmatic work.</narrative>
  </description>
